AB  - The paper provides a description of development of prices and consumption of sugar in the Czech Republic. The analysis focuses on the impact of average inflation rate and reduced rate of VAT on the given parameters. Price and consumption of sugar depend on the development of a number of variables. No significant dependence was detected either with regard to the inflation rate or to the reduced rate of VAT. Strong negative correlation between reduced tax rate and sugar consumption was confirmed among the examined variables.
